{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Robot finds object. Takes object, processes object, moves. Alternatively, robot approaches object and scans area for object. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject     /> <Action ID = ProcessObject     /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination     /> <Action ID = ApproachObject     /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject     /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject     /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached     /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible     />",
